{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/636594-vampires-and-social-media","id":636594,"title":"Vampires and Social Media","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Vampire: The Requiem"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-08-22T20:55:51-07:00","id":636594,"title":"Vampires and Social Media","content":"As my lady has been familarizing herself with 2nd edition a question came up. It's been around 10 years since the 1st edition of VTR came out. Back the cellphones weren't smart, a social media was mostly Twitter and MySpace.<br /> <br /> Today Smartphones are virtually the standard and Social media has expanded to the point that a large percentage of the population uses it on multiple sites.<br /> <br /> So what about the All Night Society. How well have they adapted to use these tools, if at all?<br /> <br /> Is it just that fad that neonates cling to, or are their Prince's and Primogen who have instagram accounts?<br /> <br /> What do you guys think?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2704-deimosmasque","name":"DeimosMasque","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2704_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"105"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-22T21:20:05-07:00","id":636636,"title":"","content":"There's a passage in the 2nd edition book (pg. 67) that talks about torpor leaving a Kindred's mind soft and pliable. Sure, neonates use Twitter, Instagram, et al because that's how they lived. However, I play newly arisen elders as taking to modern technology like fish to water. That just leaves ancillae and elders nearing torpor as the ones that are out of touch. I like it that way, actually, as my players can never be quite sure who (or what) they're dealing with from night to night. That girl in the corner at Elysium that spends all of her time buried in her iPhone? She could just be a neonate, or she could be a five-hundred year old elder that is systematically ruining your latest business venture through stock trading manipulations.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1257-kerensky","name":"Kerensky","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1257_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"72"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-22T21:30:20-07:00","id":636663,"title":"","content":"Wow, okay I really like that. And it will even fit in well with the revised setting I'm working on","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2704-deimosmasque","name":"DeimosMasque","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2704_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"105"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-23T07:24:51-07:00","id":636981,"title":"","content":"Torpor trips in order to soften up the mind and let you adapt to modern society is actually considered a reason why its considered healthy to take long naps instead of staying awake forever. Eventually, you become static and unable to adapt, stuck in your ways. <br /> <br /> So, the ones who've been awake for a while probably haven't kept up as much as the newly risen or the freshly Embraced, it is absolutely true that the All Night Society as a whole is quite modern instead of anachronistic. I'm willing to bet there's a thousand year old vampire who's a brony somewhere in the world.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2102-mcn","name":"MCN","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2102_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3479"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-23T10:46:59-07:00","id":637168,"title":"","content":"There's a vampire in Immortal Sinners who has a rather large web presence through an online persona of Nimue, depicted with somewhat misleading images. She sort of 'pretends' to be a vampire online but a lot of younger vampires have realized what she is and she talks and listens to them and through that has gained a surprising amount of power, mostly through information and loyalty.<br /> <br /> There's a few paragraphs about this, too.<br /> <br /> 'Vampires are blogging about being vampires, they\u2019re writing vampire slashfic, they\u2019re posting YouTube videos, they\u2019re advertising on Craig\u2019s List. They\u2019ve taken the purloined letter and cut it up, spelling new stories with the words it contained. There\u2019s so much bullshit, so much noise that the true signal gets lost, and the \u2019net savvy tend to sneer at even the most egregious Masquerade breach.'","signature":"","edited":{"userid":886,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","user":"nofather","date":". 08-23-2015, 01:49 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-23T10:58:40-07:00","id":637174,"title":"","content":"I actually think today you can have anachronism running even with neonates. Think about someone who got Embraced 20 or 30 years ago? Its nothing for the All Night Society. But it is too much time for modern technology and social media.<br /> <br /> Comparatively, a vampire that was Embraced 30 years ago went undead before Vampire: The Masquerade.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>#NothingAboutUsWithoutUs<br /> #AutismPride<br /> She/her pronouns","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5826-monteparnas","name":"monteparnas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5826_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6710"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-25T12:27:43-07:00","id":639369,"title":"","content":"Huh, didn't even think of it from that perspective. Cause yeah technology has changed loads just since VtR 1st edition came out and that's only about a decade ago (I think.) There could easily be ten year old neonates clinging to their myspace and live journal accounts with cellphones that can't even take pictures because they just don't understand why they need to make any of those changes.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2704-deimosmasque","name":"DeimosMasque","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2704_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"105"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-25T12:35:48-07:00","id":639377,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>DeimosMasque</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/636594-vampires-and-social-media#post636594\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">As my lady has been familarizing herself with 2nd edition a question came up. It's been around 10 years since the 1st edition of VTR came out. Back the cellphones weren't smart, a social media was mostly Twitter and MySpace.<br /> <br /> Today Smartphones are virtually the standard and Social media has expanded to the point that a large percentage of the population uses it on multiple sites.<br /> <br /> So what about the All Night Society. How well have they adapted to use these tools, if at all?<br /> <br /> Is it just that fad that neonates cling to, or are their Prince's and Primogen who have instagram accounts?<br /> <br /> What do you guys think?</div> </div> </div> </div>New tech means bringing in new skilled hands and even if the Prince isn't with the times, he/she knows how to delegate to a Kindred that is and any kindred worth his/her salt knows a untapped line of power and influence when they see one.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/604-shock","name":"Shock","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar604_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1071"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-25T15:36:02-07:00","id":639527,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>DeimosMasque</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/636594-vampires-and-social-media?p=639369#post639369\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Huh, didn't even think of it from that perspective. Cause yeah technology has changed loads just since VtR 1st edition came out and that's only about a decade ago (I think.) There could easily be ten year old neonates clinging to their myspace and live journal accounts with cellphones that can't even take pictures because they just don't understand why they need to make any of those changes.</div> </div> </div> </div> Why keep up with any changes? Because if your'e going to be a successful social predator, you need to. The Harpies have their own twitter following. The latest parties are announced on facebook through certain friends. The Cacaphony spreads more through group chat than street tags. <br /> <br /> If you want to stay relevant, you need to keep up at least a little bit. Otherwise, you'll be outclassed. Its sink or swim in this shark tank. <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2102-mcn","name":"MCN","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2102_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3479"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-25T17:55:11-07:00","id":639662,"title":"","content":"I actually think a neonate with a few decades is the trully anachronistic monster out there. Too close to humanity yet to have such a keen notion on how important it is to keep with the times. An elder already know by personal experience the toll it can take, and make an effort to keep with times or find a thrall who can.<br /> <br /> By the way, nowadays we have young normal people who have this difficulty. Imagine a young undead.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>#NothingAboutUsWithoutUs<br /> #AutismPride<br /> She/her pronouns","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5826-monteparnas","name":"monteparnas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5826_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6710"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}